Cooling Topology is part of Data Center Control Plane (DCCP), Tranche 3: Cooling
Infrastructure Control. It is repository 26 of the DCCP program and owns the
generation-bound structural model of data-centre cooling connectivity.

Third-party notices
-------------------

This product includes no third-party source code and links no third-party
libraries. It is implemented against the C++20 standard library and the
operating-system interfaces it needs for durable atomic file replacement,
advisory file locking and non-interactive process termination in tests.

The canonical serialization format, the integrity digest (SHA-256, FIPS 180-4)
and every identity, generation, epoch and incarnation type are implemented in
this repository.
